{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"十有一年春，宋公之弟辰及仲佗、石彄、公子地自陳入于蕭以叛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"秋，宋樂大心自曹入于蕭。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"冬，及鄭平。叔還如鄭涖盟。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"十一年春，宋公母弟辰暨仲佗、石彄、公子地入于蕭以叛。秋，樂大心從之，大為宋患，寵向魋故也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_224_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_224","textTraditional":"冬，及鄭平，始叛晉也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}